                                                "sense_id": "abfdbdb4-fa46-3fc1-8fd8-65b8dbda65a2",
                                                "text": "For so long, Theon Greyjoy was the punching bag of Game of Thrones, a sort of shitty Charlie Brown who not only failed to kick the football, but would then be beaten savagely with it every time he landed on his ass."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ecd212ee-fdad-4a40-b43e-d21b3338bd32",
                                                "sense_id": "abfdbdb4-fa46-3fc1-8fd8-65b8dbda65a2",
                                                "text": "The response was swift, and [Harold] Bloom became a punching bag for leftist critics, who valued literature’s power to deliver social and political messages for the underrepresented."
                                            }
